1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,007
Every afternoon, in our house, a ritual
begins.

2
00:00:06,107 --> 00:00:11,591
Fresh grass is spread on the floor. The
little cups are lined up on the rekebot.

3
00:00:12,691 --> 00:00:15,987
The green beans are washed and roasted
in the pan.

4
00:00:15,987 --> 00:00:18,162
The house fills with their scent.

5
00:00:19,262 --> 00:00:25,729
The smoke is carried to everyone in the
room. No one is left out.

6
00:00:26,829 --> 00:00:32,368
The first cup is called abol. It is
strong, like a beginning.

7
00:00:33,468 --> 00:00:38,984
Popcorn is passed around, incense burns.
The conversation begins.

8
00:00:40,084 --> 00:00:44,909
The second is tona. It is lighter, and
the talk grows warmer.

9
00:00:46,009 --> 00:00:52,156
Here, news is shared, quarrels are
mended, laughter is passed around.

10
00:00:53,256 --> 00:00:58,751
The third is bereka. It means blessing.
To leave before it would be rude.

11
00:00:59,851 --> 00:01:04,546
Coffee is not just a drink. It is time
we spend together.

12
00:01:04,546 --> 00:01:08,499
When we are far from home, this is what
we miss.
